<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLOs end strong, Bfr pressure wanes.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLOs end strong, Bfr pressure wanes.</headline>
<text>
<p>1518 GMT - Belgian OLOs close strong in line with Bunds as pressure on Belgian franc wanes. Next target U.S. CPI data due Thursday.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.77% (5.83) BE286=, 10 bps over Bunds (11)</p>
<p>*OLO fut +0.36 at 121.99 BGBc1 ; Mark/Bfr 20.6395/05 (6410/20)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.20/22% (21/22), 1-wk repo 3.08/12 (unch)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
